---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'

const updated = 'August 9, 2026'
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | MM2Shark"
  description="Privacy Policy for MM2Shark.com — what information we collect, how we use it, and your choices."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <header class="legal-head">
      <p class="legal-kicker">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how MM2Shark.com (“MM2Shark”, “we”, “us”) handles information
        when you use the website. MM2Shark is a fan-made Murder Mystery 2 values site.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>Depending on how you use the site, we may process:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage data</strong> — pages viewed, approximate location from IP, browser type,
          device type, and referring URL (typical web server / analytics data).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Technical data</strong> — cookies or local storage needed for basic site function
          (for example preferences), if enabled.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Messages you send us</strong> — if you contact us on Discord or another channel,
          we receive whatever you choose to share.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not require an account to browse the public value list or calculator.</p>

      <h2>2. How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To operate, secure, and improve MM2Shark.com</li>
        <li>To understand which pages are useful and fix bugs</li>
        <li>To respond when you contact us</li>
        <li>To protect against abuse or misuse</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Cookies and similar tech</h2>
      <p>
        The site may use essential cookies or local storage for basic functionality. If we add
        analytics or advertising later, we will update this page and, where required, ask for
        consent.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information. We may use trusted hosting or infrastructure
        providers (for example Cloudflare) that process data to deliver the website. We may also
        disclose information if required by law or to protect the site and users.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Children’s privacy</h2>
      <p>
        MM2Shark is a general Roblox-related fan site. We do not knowingly collect personal
        information from children for marketing. If you believe a child provided personal data,
        contact us and we will delete it where appropriate.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        Server and analytics logs are kept only as long as needed for security, operations, and
        improvement, then deleted or anonymized according to our providers’ practices.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can clear cookies and site data in your browser. For access or deletion requests about
        information you sent us directly, contact us on Discord and describe the request.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        Links to Discord, Roblox, or other sites are outside our control. Their privacy practices
        apply on those services.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy. The “Last updated” date at the top will change when we
        do. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions:
        <a href="mailto:contact@mm2shark.com">contact@mm2shark.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
